title: R1_1
---
<<if change_person("Hilaire", "Neutral")>>
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Hello assistant.
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Do you happen to know why we are missing 300 gold from our vault?
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Gwendolen was supposed to receive 300 gold as an award. Do you know anything about this?
<<trigger_talk>>
Hilaire: Let me know if you recall anything.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_2
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Angry")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Attendant!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I need your help, someone knows a dark secret of mine and I am required to send them gold.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Can you help me set up this arrangement ASAP? I will send over their pidegeon number so you can work out the details.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Thanks for letting me know this info, you’re a lifesaver!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_3
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello assistant. Thank the magical wonders that you brought me Meredith’s scroll!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: If I would have ignored her scrolls three times in a row, the skies would have turned purple and the thunder would be the least of our worries.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_4
---
<<if change_person("Cressida", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: Good morning, Attendant.
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: Yesterday there was an incident involving a pigeon. 
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: It had - luckily - been lost on the way to something called “Treasury Lodge” and had found its way into our treasury instead. 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: Of course, I reviewed yesterday’s communications, and I am pleased to see that you caught the scam and reported it! 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: As I care deeply for security, you have my thanks. 
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Cressida: If you’ll excuse me, I’ll go have a word with Tilly now…
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_5
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hi attendant. Thank you for your hard work. 
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: My friend over on Oberon Reanimation got a concerning scroll the other day, blackmailing her about her dark secrets.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Luckily, all her dark secrets are already out in the open, so it must be a scam, haha!
<<trigger_talk>> 
Gwendolen: If I had gotten such a scroll I would have sent them all my gold…
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>> 
Gwendolen: Keep your eyes peeled!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R1_6
---
<<if change_person("Meredith", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Meredith: Greetings, attendant.
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Meredith: Gwendolen has been ignoring me for three days now. 
<<trigger_talk>>
Meredith: When I confronted her, she said she only remembers ignoring me for two of those days!
<<trigger_talk>>
Meredith: Can you believe her!?
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Meredith: Would you PLEASE, make sure she gets my scrolls?
<<end_of_response>>
===

