title: R2_1
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Angry")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Attendant! 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Please help me, nothing is working anymore!
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I must have missed some words in the attunement spell or something, I think my tome is now corrupt!
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Please go ask Tilly to come to me as soon as she has time!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R2_2
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Thanks for letting me know about the delayed delivery yesterday!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I didn’t know Refractors & Prisms doesn’t use Brooms Express anymore… 
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: But of course I claimed the compensation as Hilaire has been nagging me about keeping costs down. 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: She’ll be thrilled, AND as I gave them High Wizard’s seal he’s automatically getting a really good deal on future orders!
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: You know he loves prisms!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R2_3
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello attendant.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I must have completely missed that the Pendragon arcane and communications conference was moved to next week!
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: On a separate note, do you know why the “Magical Seal Deal and Protection Service” warned me about attuning my magical seal to shady organisations this morning?
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R2_4
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello assistant.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I heard that Cambion’s tome got corrupted yesterday after getting a request to cast an attunement spell.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Luckily I wasn’t requested to do my own attunement, I always mess up the order of the words in those as well.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: If you see such a request, let Tilly know immediately so that she can help me with it.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R2_5
---
<<if change_person("Berg", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Hello attendant, is everything in order?
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Harlis Dorn at Refractors and Prisms spoke to me yesterday.
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: They had an incantation incident last week, and lost their tome of customers in the void. 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: He said that multiple customers have been receiving scrolls from “Cat’s delivery” or something.
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: He told me that they keep using Broom’s Express for now, despite the constant delivery issues.
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Be careful, will you?
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R2_6
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Hello attendant!
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwen: The Pendragon arcane and communications conference committee issued a warning about impersonators asking for employees' magical seals through scrolls.
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwen: Since I never received such a scroll, it must mean that your second day at work went great!
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwen: Keep up the good work.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwen: Now, maybe we should assign you to read all the scrolls at this place.
<<end_of_response>>
===

